<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SIKMA - Portal Walisantri</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/images/logo-madrasah.webp">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <script src="/js/tailwind-config.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-40">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex justify-between h-16 items-center">
        <a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="/">
          <div class="bg-brand-500 text-white p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md"><i class="bi bi-wallet2 text-lg"></i></div>
          <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-brand-600">SIKMA</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/login" class="bg-brand-50 hover:bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Login Admin
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 relative">
    
    <!-- Background Decoration -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-96 h-96 bg-brand-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl absolute -top-20 -left-20"></div>
      <div class="w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl absolute -bottom-20 -right-20"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl w-full text-center bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-10 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 relative z-10 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-orange-500 to-rose-500"></div>
      
      <!-- Animated Icon -->
      <div class="w-24 h-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-100 to-orange-100 text-orange-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-8 shadow-inner transform -rotate-6">
        <i class="bi bi-cone-striped text-5xl"></i>
      </div>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight">Sedang Dalam Pengembangan</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-500 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Mohon maaf, halaman Portal Walisantri SIKMA saat ini belum dapat diakses oleh publik karena masih dalam tahap pengembangan dan penyempurnaan sistem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">Khusus Pengelola / Admin:</p>
        <a href="/login" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-slate-900/20 active:scale-95">
          <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i> Akses Backend
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">&copy; 2026 SIKMA. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
